29:40.710 --> 29:41.390
Belum sempat cakap banyak,

29:42.060 --> 29:43.190
awak pula ungkit luka lama saya.

29:47.950 --> 29:48.670
Pasti ada jalannya nanti.

29:53.710 --> 29:54.390
Betul,

29:56.190 --> 29:57.260
